<TemplateLayout title="The school | Dharmic Data" description="Imagine Conscious Compute with Jai. Paid learning, deep mentorship and work communities can carry forward." active="school">
  <section class="template-page-hero template-wrap"><p class="subtitle">Dharmic Data / The emerging school</p><h1>Imagine a school.<br/><span class="sticker green">Build it together.</span></h1><p>Conscious Compute is our signature workshop series. Bring an idea, work with people who can help, and learn to carry it forward.</p><a class="primary-button about-primary" href="/learn">Start learning with Jai ↗</a></section>
  <section id="experience" class="about-choices template-school-experience"><div class="about-section-heading"><p class="subtitle">What you learn and make</p><h2>Imagination.<br/><span class="sticker coral">With people beside you.</span></h2><p>AI can produce something faster than we learn to judge it. A teacher makes room to ask what it means, who it helps and what needs to change.</p></div><ol class="choice-grid"><li><span>01 / A learner, mentor and host</span><h3>Imagine with someone.</h3><p>Choose something worth making for a community. Your questions help shape the work.</p></li><li><span>02 / Time to practice judgment</span><h3>Make it. Question it.</h3><p>Build with available AI. Explain your choices, try the result with its intended user, and make time for feedback.</p></li><li><span>03 / Another person can continue</span><h3>Pass the capability on.</h3><p>Return to a fresh problem. Give the host what they need to maintain the work. Help another teacher lead the experience.</p></li></ol></section>
  <section class="template-civilization"><div class="template-wrap template-two-column"><div><p class="subtitle white">The long view</p><h2>What we teach<br/><span class="sticker yellow">outlives us.</span></h2><div class="epic-titles" aria-label="Homer's epics"><span class="sticker coral">The Iliad</span><span class="sticker green">The Odyssey</span></div></div><div><p>Homer's epics became part of how ancient Greeks learned and argued about what a good life required. Generations of performers, teachers and readers carried those stories forward.</p><p>I return to that history because teaching helps people decide what is worth doing with their abilities. Our imagination gives us somewhere to begin.</p><p>A good teacher can change the course of someone's life. A great teacher can change the course of an entire civilization.</p><a class="about-text-link light" href="https://literature.dharmicdata.org">Explore the Civilizational Shelf ↗</a><p class="template-note">My tribute to Jiang Xueqin's Predictive History. <a href="https://classics.mit.edu/Plato/republic.11.x.html">Read the ancient debate about Homer's influence.</a></p></div></div></section>
  <section class="template-wrap template-school-model"><p class="subtitle">American Exceptionalism, in my words</p><h2>A future people<br/><span class="sticker green">have a stake in.</span></h2><p class="template-lead">Taking responsibility for improving the institutions we depend on, through imagination and cooperation. Then sharing the means for others to contribute.</p><div class="template-two-column"><div><h3>Start learning now.</h3><p>Online workshops and cohorts. In-person workshops with community organizations every two weeks as hosts and funding come together.</p><p>Funded learner places are paid. Premium attendees pay separately. Network facilitators can help repeat the experience through licensed curriculum.</p></div><div class="template-funding"><span class="sticker yellow">Seeking support</span><h3>Three pilots.<br/>Then a larger school.</h3><p>We are seeking $100,000 for the first test, with a desired larger launch in June 2027. Dates depend on funding and host readiness.</p><a class="about-text-link" href="mailto:jai@aplusactive.com?subject=Helping%20build%20Dharmic%20Data">Help shape the school ↗</a></div></div></section>
</TemplateLayout>
